SUMMARY:Garden to Table class: Butterfly Waffles
DESCRIPTION:Garden To Table Family Class:\nMondays\, 4:00 – 5:00PM \nApril 20 – Butterfly Waffles\nWhen exploring the gardens you are sure to spot monarch butterflies. Join us for our April Garden to Table class to make Butterfly Waffles\, and learn more about why monarchs are so important to have in our gardens. \nEnjoy quality time in the garden with your child/children as we explore the Edible Garden and all that it has to offer. Help us weed and water\, plant\, and harvest. We will prepare a simple snack with ingredients inspired by the garden. Appropriate for children ages 4 and up but all are welcome. Children must be accompanied by an adult.\nFee: $15/class per child for Members / $20/class per child for General Public\nMay 18 – Fruit & Veggie Critters\nJune 8 – Herb Butter \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/garden-to-table-class-butterfly-waffles/
