SUMMARY:Game Night: Dungeons and Dragons
DESCRIPTION:Adventurers! Join us for a fun and fantastical one shot D&D campaign. We embrace the quirky\, the chaotic\, and the downright silly. No experience necessary\, we welcome players of all skill levels. We’re all about having a good laugh and creating unforgettable memories together. Players aged 16 and up are welcome to play. This is a safe space for all\, including LGBTQIA+ and Neurodiverse folk. \nPlayers will be playing the one shot The Chaotic Invasion: The village of Greenmeadow is ready for its annual Spring Festival. The central square is decorated with giant\, colorful eggs\, and the air smells of sweet pastries. Everything is peaceful until Barnaby “Lop-Ears”—a disgruntled ex-bard wearing a filthy rabbit disguise—decides to ruin the holiday. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/game-night-dungeons-and-dragons/
